cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Grounding-Source Comparison Exhibit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Clouatre"
    given-names: "Hugues"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4291-1999"
    affiliation: "Universite de Bordeaux"
repository-code: https://github.com/clouatre-labs/grounding-source-exhibit
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-11-20"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered comparison of three grounding-source payloads (llms.txt,
  knowledge-graph.json with a deterministic cluster slice, and the OKF v0.3
  bundle) on 103 reading-chain questions per arm, with an exact sequence
  match primary metric and a pre-registered per-step prefix-credit
  secondary metric. DOI identifiers will be added after Zenodo deposit.
keywords:
  - llm-agents
  - knowledge-graph
  - open-knowledge-format
  - pre-registered-experiment
  - reproducibility
  - llm-evaluation
